<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">{Attach appropriate Client BAAG/Client Contribution sheet/401(k) Plan Outline}</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Client</span>:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>I would like to share some helpful resources to help you attract the best candidates for growth at your company. Highlighting the benefits that are provided through the Insperity relationship will assist you in accomplishing this goal.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>I have attached several documents that you can provide potential candidates and have outlined information about each below.</font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial"><b>Benefits At A Glance Brochure</b>: Provides a high-level overview of the benefits available to employees in the current coverage period.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial"><b>Employee Contribution Report</b>: Provides information about benefits cost during the current coverage period.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial"><b>401(k) Plan Outline</b>: Outlines eligibility requirements and other specific details for the 401(k) plan.&nbsp;</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Your Payroll Specialist can assist with priming the new employee's information into the Insperity Paperless Onboarding system.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Insperity can also assist with the initial recruiting of candidates, employment screening, and background checks. I am happy to connect you to the Insperity Talent Acquisition Services team for more information.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Signature]</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>